17. Bonus Module: ISO-TP
The repository also ships a separate, optional ISO 15765-2 (ISO-TP) transport-layer module (isotp.h / isotp.tpp) that layers multi-frame messaging on top of a FlexCAN_T4 bus object — useful for UDS/diagnostic-style payloads larger than a single CAN frame.

#include <FlexCAN_T4.h>
#include <isotp.h>

FlexCAN_T4<CAN1, RX_SIZE_256, TX_SIZE_16> Can1;
