Key pieces:

ISOTP_data struct: id, flags.extended, flags.usePadding, flags.separation_uS, len, blockSize, flow_control_type (0=Clear to Send, 1=Wait, 2=Abort), separation_time.
ISOTP_RXBANKS_TABLE: RX_BANKS_2 … RX_BANKS_1024, the first template parameter (reassembly buffer depth).
isotp1.write(config, buf, size) — send an arbitrary-length buffer, automatically segmented into CAN frames.
isotp1.sendFlowControl(config) — manually send a flow-control frame.
isotp1.setPadding(byte) — set the pad byte used when usePadding is set (default 0xA5).
This module is a separate feature from the core FlexCAN_T4/FlexCAN_T4FD classes documented above; treat it as an add-on for diagnostic/transport-layer use cases.

